ecision was made with Qantas' sole discretion and are contingent on continued compliance with your obligations within Qantas' Standard Agency Terms and Conditions available on the homepage of the Qantas Agency Connect site.<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000170BDF10"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000170B9B40"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="00000000170C0910">Please note:</strong>&nbsp;This inbox is solely used to process applications for Qantas Ticketing Authority. If your email does not include an application, it is likely you will not receive a response.<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000170B9A30"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000170B97F0">If you have a related general enquiry, please go to Qantas Agency Connect, or reach out to your local Qantas representative or relevant contact point outlined below:</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000170C0B70"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000170B75E0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000170BB080"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000170BB410" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 30px; height: 30px;"><table class="demo" align="center" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000170B8660" style="border-collapse: collapse; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(221, 221, 221); padding: 10px;"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000170B8790"><td data_liveedit_tagid="00000000170B88C0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(221, 221, 221); padding: 10px;"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="00000000170B89F0"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Australia</font></strong></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="00000000170B8B20" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; border-bottom: 1px 